# age key pairs. docs/backups.md says to generate these outside any working
# tree, but `age-keygen -o companion-backup-key.txt` writes to the CURRENT
# directory — so if that instruction is followed from inside the repo, the
# private half of the backup key lands right here. This is the backstop.
*key.txt
*.age

